Defect: SMI-INVALID-DATE https://pysnmp.github.io/pysmi/stable/mib-defects.html#smi-invalid-date

LAST-UPDATED reads 03202001. That is not year-first, since there is no
month 20; it is March 20, 2001 written month, day, year. The repair
writes the same day in the SMI's form, at 00:00.

No publisher on record serves this module, so the baseline is the text
this repository carried before the repair; which publication that was is
not recovered.

--- a/VERITAS-CLUSTER-MIB
+++ b/VERITAS-CLUSTER-MIB
@@ -91,7 +91,7 @@
      products                OBJECT IDENTIFIER ::= { veritassoftware 3 }
 
      veritasCluster MODULE-IDENTITY
-     LAST-UPDATED "03202001"
+     LAST-UPDATED "200103200000Z"
      ORGANIZATION "VERITAS Software, Inc."
      CONTACT-INFO "1600 Plymouth Street.
                    Mountain View, CA 94043 US
